<title>HONG KONG: Bank of America names Asian private banking head.</title>
<headline>Bank of America names Asian private banking head.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of America said on Friday that senior vice president Anthony Moody had been appointed head of international private banking for Asia.</p>
<p>Moody will be based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6352</p>
</text>
